msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/editionOfFunctionality|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Read together with logic:characteristicSort: the pair (logic:characterizes gmeow:editionOf, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) is the whole obligation, and the OWL grounding view projects the matching characteristic from it."
msgstr "与 logic:characteristicSort 一并阅读：(logic:characterizes gmeow:editionOf, logic:characteristicSort logic:functionalProperty) 这一对构成完整义务，OWL 基础视图据此投影出相应特征。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/editionOfFunctionality|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:editionOfFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:editionOf ."
msgstr "gmeow:editionOfFunctionality logic:characterizes gmeow:editionOf ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/counterpartOfSymmetry|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Scope: this record carries ONE integrity obligation about gmeow:counterpartOf and nothing else. It is not a definition of gmeow:counterpartOf (that lives on the term itself), not a shape, and not a second place to state the term's meaning — retire the record rather than broaden it."
msgstr "范围：该记录仅承载关于 gmeow:counterpartOf 的一项完整性义务，别无其他。它不是 gmeow:counterpartOf 的定义（定义位于术语自身），不是形状，也不是重述该术语含义的第二处位置——应撤回该记录而非扩大其范围。"

